	(text "written, which under-drove every LED on the board -- see the F1 note block)."
		(at 400.05 35.56 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "35f1ccaa-e497-4240-a136-b9a76825c179")
	)
	(text "The value cannot simply be reduced: it is pinned between the part's 7-15mA"
		(at 400.05 40.64 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "34646e4e-d0a6-4080-bd2a-21401fdb61cd")
	)
	(text "recommended band and its 7.0mA worst-case switching threshold. A driver pin"
		(at 400.05 45.72 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "6de83f59-6ad8-4648-b4eb-8b05ae448c6f")
	)
	(text "with TWO LEDs on it sinks double, which is what this note block is about; F1"
		(at 400.05 50.800000000000004 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "00d30f56-9780-4a4f-8105-25f22db432b9")
	)
	(text "separately gives each SINGLE LED two outputs, which is the opposite thing."
		(at 400.05 55.88 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "7b36b6c8-4535-4dd3-8321-9669563ed4c2")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 400.05 60.96 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "c5bc31cb-9f57-4881-9c94-57f990ac1b5a")
	)
	(text "The _BUF bank names 19 SIGNALS, but the board carries 30 LEDs. The 11 unnamed"
		(at 400.05 66.03999999999999 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "7067507a-efc6-4781-ab2c-55368dfb882a")
	)
	(text "ones were doubled up: EVT_STROBE_BUF, RWD_CMD_BUF and STIM_TRIG_BUF each fed"
		(at 400.05 71.12 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "f9b1c2ec-8498-466e-b8f0-4d09ce72bc17")
	)
	(text "an NI LED AND an Intan LED from one HCT541 output (14.7mA vs 6mA IOL), and"
		(at 400.05 76.2 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "a67468a6-19ae-489c-9bab-9055e556aee7")
	)
	(text "bare RWD_DLVR fed both of its optocouplers straight off the 74HCT32 reward-OR"
		(at 400.05 81.28 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "0d25aecb-6aad-4350-8cbf-409abae6817e")
	)
	(text "gate (14.7mA vs 4mA IOL). That last one was the dangerous one: RWD_DLVR's LOW"
		(at 400.05 86.36 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "18ed7f66-f21c-4161-b6d2-72832bd7b128")
	)
	(text "is read by the LVC541 level-shifter (V_IL,max 0.8V), and an HCT gate's VOL at"
		(at 400.05 91.44 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "e1d39099-da8c-4895-914d-b31230bee8c5")
	)
	(text "3.7x its rated sink plausibly exceeds that -- leaving RWD_DLVR_PI stuck HIGH,"
		(at 400.05 96.52 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "c828ccae-f816-41fa-af89-e1314dd03ef2")
	)
	(text "the sync module recording reward-delivered continuously. Same failure"
		(at 400.05 101.6 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "acccbebc-752a-4115-ba38-65fe60759194")
	)
	(text "signature as the reward-OR polarity defect caught here at fix round 1."
		(at 400.05 106.67999999999999 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "83efef19-b0a2-4551-8dd4-c1c7dfdd9a08")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 400.05 111.75999999999999 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "45b7ffbb-e1d8-4904-b5dd-a0a8869b2c67")
	)
	(text "The third _BUF package's 5 spare channels are now spent, one LED per pin:"
		(at 400.05 116.83999999999999 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "36f31bf2-44d2-4571-84a1-1f840830ccbe")
	)
	(text "  ch3 EVT_STROBE_CLAMP -> EVT_STROBE_INTAN_BUF   (opto-intan U64 ch1)"
		(at 400.05 121.92 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "f8589b23-5118-4d80-929d-6e749f4a376e")
	)
	(text "  ch4 RWD_CMD_CLAMP    -> RWD_CMD_INTAN_BUF      (opto-intan U64 ch3)"
		(at 400.05 127.0 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "88d1e680-1832-4a8f-bbe4-f87920a6edd8")
	)
	(text "  ch5 STIM_TRIG_CLAMP  -> STIM_TRIG_INTAN_BUF    (opto-intan U65 ch1)"
		(at 400.05 132.08 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "57cb1fdc-f2b9-42da-81d6-fe070d3de88d")
	)
	(text "  ch6 RWD_DLVR         -> RWD_DLVR_BUF           (opto-ni    U60 ch4)"
		(at 400.05 137.16 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "40ab8516-532a-471f-bc12-0f3a0effa4d5")
	)
	(text "  ch7 RWD_DLVR         -> RWD_DLVR_INTAN_BUF     (opto-intan U64 ch4)"
		(at 400.05 142.24 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "405609ff-1d3b-4acf-b7d1-1b6efe8b6919")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 400.05 147.32000000000002 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "ab714912-b445-40cc-893b-f04ce85c1d9c")
	)
	(text "The three *_INTAN_BUF legs tap the SAME *_CLAMP node their NI twin already"
		(at 400.05 152.4 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "4a1684c4-6e0f-45c6-b7e3-cba31ceba5d3")
	)
	(text "taps -- the established fan-out point, one protection network with N buffered"
		(at 400.05 157.48000000000002 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "5f08dd29-17d2-4540-9944-2eb90966153e")
	)
	(text "copies hanging off it, exactly as the LVC541 and HCT541 banks already share"
		(at 400.05 162.56 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "e56d41b4-fb29-43ea-b94e-1a78f4a326b3")
	)
	(text "it. The two RWD_DLVR legs tap RWD_DLVR itself, which afterwards drives only"
		(at 400.05 167.64000000000001 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "54103bd6-54a7-453a-aee3-f5c348e29182")
	)
	(text "CMOS inputs and a panel header: ~0mA DC out of the 74HCT32."
		(at 400.05 172.72 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "ab09e5c7-f376-4ea9-a32e-cfdd2586a35e")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 400.05 177.8 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "cfac40d9-e55f-4a70-b590-167e73d5a30b")
	)
	(text "DRIVER PART IS SN74AHCT541PW, NOT SN74HCT541PW (Value/MPN only -- identical"
		(at 400.05 182.88000000000002 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "49d9ffb4-2170-452c-b72f-40c37a37719f")
	)
	(text "pinout and TSSOP-20 footprint, both symbols extend the same 74LS541 KiCad"
		(at 400.05 187.96 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "e32fea3a-591e-4f9c-8ffe-4d9195366f94")
	)
	(text "part). Each LED is 7.33mA, fixed by the LED's own 7.0mA worst-case switching"
		(at 400.05 193.04000000000002 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "6e1dde5c-ed01-451c-829d-732593fc605c")
	)
	(text "threshold, not a driver choice. HCT541's own rated IOL is 6mA (7.33mA is 22%"
		(at 400.05 198.12 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "20e87d47-8574-46b5-bfa4-ad92cea37a5f")
	)
	(text "over, and self-consistently against the part's own ~55ohm output impedance --"
		(at 400.05 203.20000000000002 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "96c38ebb-d723-4129-8b35-21fae0b6cf10")
	)
	(text "not the single 6mA datasheet test point -- closer to 7.18mA against that same"
		(at 400.05 208.28 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "df5d08dd-afb6-422d-9a65-b891411adc7a")
	)
	(text "7.0mA floor). AHCT541's rated IOL is 8mA: 7.33mA is fully compliant, and both"
		(at 400.05 213.36 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "31f6fc20-cb4d-4122-bfb8-59a2dfaf3f64")
	)
	(text "absolute maxima double (25mA->50mA/pin, 70mA->100mA/package), retiring the"
		(at 400.05 218.44 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "7b016c86-bfd9-42bc-97c2-681f8f9a5cea")
	)
	(text "separate 58.6mA-of-70mA concern on U8/U9/U10 too."
		(at 400.05 223.52 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "b2375f2d-b072-4de5-a58c-dfcb604006c4")
	)
