		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "a0396b7e-8abf-41eb-b64b-7107475f773f")
	)
	(text "       (6 spare channels, the headroom finding F4's camera triggers need)"
		(at 560.07 476.25 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "e9aa34b9-bd51-42a4-9293-82e9c64f0e6a")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 560.07 481.33000000000004 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "46965e94-0f18-4b17-b5fd-1b35b24d8c80")
	)
	(text "Each pair shares ONE input net, and that is a safety requirement rather than"
		(at 560.07 486.41 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "84dc7c72-d527-419f-9ffe-20c8c5ed2ea5")
	)
	(text "tidiness: two tri-state outputs on one net are safe only while both are"
		(at 560.07 491.49 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "6343c8c8-faf8-4fde-93ad-66772da2e0dd")
	)
	(text "guaranteed to drive the same direction. If their inputs ever differed, one"
		(at 560.07 496.57000000000005 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "ae013ca4-6bf3-4829-a412-2ca22e6a7636")
	)
	(text "would source while the other sinks, limited by nothing but the two output"
		(at 560.07 501.65000000000003 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "433fe4cc-1e83-411b-b666-9ac8d6696c0e")
	)
	(text "stages. The channel maps here are MIRRORED from the tables that built the"
		(at 560.07 506.73 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "36c9598e-3ca1-4d7b-aea4-18646599e232")
	)
	(text "first leg rather than retyped, so the two cannot drift apart."
		(at 560.07 511.81000000000006 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "3315b172-af81-4c30-bdc7-9f0a1e83cfed")
	)
